 "title": "Naindeep Singh",
 "intro": "Report an officeholder change\nNaindeep Singh is a member of the Central Unified Board of Trustees in California, representing Trustee Area 7. He assumed office in 2018. His current term ends on December 11, 2026. Singh did not run for re-election to Central Unified School District Board of Trustees Trustee Area 7 in 2026.\nSingh ran for election to the Fresno City Council to represent District 1 in California. He was on the ballot in the general election on November 3, 2026.",
